        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<p><strong>Frequent bundles at Zava Retail Redmond are highly seasonal and consistently low-frequency.</strong> Across 2020\u20132026, the top co-purchased pair in each season appeared only <em>2\u20133 times</em> per season, with bundle share ranging from <strong>0.0088</strong> to <strong>0.0171</strong> of orders.</p><ul><li><strong>Highest bundle share:</strong> <em>Lineman's Pliers 9-inch + Needle-Nose Pliers 6-inch</em> in <strong>Spring 2022</strong>, with <strong>3</strong> co-purchases out of <strong>175</strong> orders (<strong>1.71%</strong>).</li><li><strong>Other 3-order bundles:</strong> <em>Toilet Repair Kit Complete + Plumber's Grease</em> in <strong>Winter 2024</strong> (<strong>3/204</strong>, <strong>1.47%</strong>) and <em>Angle Bracket 4-inch + Swivel Caster 2-inch</em> in <strong>Winter 2026</strong> (<strong>3/232</strong>, <strong>1.29%</strong>).</li><li><strong>Most common pattern:</strong> the top bundle in a season was usually purchased together <strong>2 times</strong>, such as <em>Flathead Screwdriver Set + Metric Wrench Set</em> in <strong>Winter 2020</strong> (<strong>2/158</strong>, <strong>1.27%</strong>) and <em>Ball Peen Hammer 12oz + Pipe Wrench Set</em> in <strong>Summer 2021</strong> (<strong>2/139</strong>, <strong>1.44%</strong>).</li><li><strong>Seasonal volume trend:</strong> eligible orders rose from <strong>652</strong> in 2020 to <strong>897</strong> in 2026, while line items increased from <strong>1,361</strong> to <strong>1,828</strong>, indicating growing basket activity even though individual bundles remained rare.</li></ul><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> the data suggests <em>opportunistic cross-sell bundles</em> rather than dominant recurring combos. The strongest bundle opportunities appear in tool-and-hardware pairings, especially in <strong>spring and winter</strong>.</p>",
            "id": 1
        },
